<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Ortiz says inflation to end yr at 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Ortiz says inflation to end yr at 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Finance Minister Guillermo Ortiz said Monday that inflation will end the year &quot;around 25 percent&quot;.</p>
<p>In a brief interview with national TV network Televisa, Ortiz added that growth next year will be higher than this year. No other predictions were given.</p>
<p>Officially, the government has a target for inflation in 1996 of 20.5 percent.</p>
<p>--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530.</p>
